7:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:tracking-tight prose-p:leading-8 prose-a:text-blue-700","children":[["$","section","What does a webmaster actually need day to day?",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What does a webmaster actually need day to day?"}],[["$","p","The webmaster role has changed. It is no longer only FTP uploads and server logs. A modern webmaster may update a blog, prepare campaign URLs, compress hero images, create QR codes for printed material, check JSON snippets, clean copied text, translate a support page, and inspect whether a timestamp in analytics matches a launch window.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"The webmaster role has changed. It is no longer only FTP uploads and server logs. A modern webmaster may update a blog, prepare campaign URLs, compress hero images, create QR codes for printed material, check JSON snippets, clean copied text, translate a support page, and inspect whether a timestamp in analytics matches a launch window."}]]}],["$","p","ToolOrbit keeps these lightweight tasks close together. The goal is fast operational work: fewer browser tabs, fewer desktop installs, and fewer one-off searches for small utilities.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"ToolOrbit keeps these lightweight tasks close together. The goal is fast operational work: fewer browser tabs, fewer desktop installs, and fewer one-off searches for small utilities."}]]}],["$","p","The common thread is that none of these tasks justifies opening a dedicated application. You do not launch Photoshop to crop a screenshot. You do not open a terminal to URL-encode a parameter. You do not boot a PDF editor to check a timestamp. The browser is the right environment for sub-minute operational tasks, and this toolkit collects the ones webmasters reach for most often.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"The common thread is that none of these tasks justifies opening a dedicated application. You do not launch Photoshop to crop a screenshot. You do not open a terminal to URL-encode a parameter. You do not boot a PDF editor to check a timestamp. The browser is the right environment for sub-minute operational tasks, and this toolkit collects the ones webmasters reach for most often."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","How webmaster utilities support SEO without pretending to be magic",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How webmaster utilities support SEO without pretending to be magic"}],[["$","p","SEO often fails because of boring publishing mistakes: oversized images, malformed data, broken campaign URLs, messy copied text, duplicated snippets, and content that was never reviewed for clarity. Webmaster tools reduce those mistakes at the point of work.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"SEO often fails because of boring publishing mistakes: oversized images, malformed data, broken campaign URLs, messy copied text, duplicated snippets, and content that was never reviewed for clarity. Webmaster tools reduce those mistakes at the point of work."}]]}],["$","p","A URL encoder will not create rankings by itself, but it prevents broken tracking links. An image compressor will not replace content strategy, but it protects load speed. A JSON formatter will not design schema for you, but it helps inspect structured payloads before deployment.",{"children":["$Lf"]}],"$L10","$L11"]]}],"$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16"]}]
